4. THE MEMORY CLAUSE
   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITH A HEAP THAT WILL BE FINE
   UNTIL 3PM ON A FRIDAY. Any resemblance to a correctly-sized JVM
   container is coincidental and will be corrected by an OOMKill,
